ium", "explanation": "Contiguous allocation fits because it can suffer from external fragmentation over time."}, {"seed_key": "demo:question:operating_systems:file_systems:7", "question_text": "Which term best matches this description: it helps a file system recover after a crash?", "options": ["Hard link", "Buffer cache", "Mount operation", "Journaling"], "correct_answer": 3, "difficulty": "medium", "explanation": "Journaling fits because it helps a file system recover after a crash."}, {"seed_key": "demo:question:operating_systems:file_systems:8", "question_text": "Which term best matches this description: it gives another directory entry that points to the same inode?", "options": ["Hard link", "Buffer cache", "Mount operation", "File system"], "correct_answer": 0, "difficulty": "hard", "explanation": "Hard link fits because it gives another directory entry that points to the same inode."}, {"seed_key": "demo:question:operating_systems:file_systems:9", "question_text": "Which term best matches this description: it reduces disk access by keeping recently used blocks in memory?", "options": ["Mount operation", "File system", "Buffer cache", "Directory"], "correct_answer": 2, "difficulty": "hard", "explanation": "Buffer cache fits because it reduces disk access by keeping recently used blocks in memory."}, {"seed_key": "demo:question:operating_systems:file_systems:10", "question_text": "Which term best matches this description: it attaches a file system into the directory tree?", "options": ["File system", "Mount operation", "Directory", "Absolute path"], "correct_answer": 1, "difficulty": "hard", "explanation": "Mount operation fits because it attaches a file system into the directory tree."}]}]}, {"name": "Aptitude and Reasoning", "slug": "aptitude_and_reasoning", "exam_title": "Aptitude and Reasoning - Comprehensive Test", "exam_description": "A 50-question demo paper on quantitative aptitude, logic, verbal reasoning, DI, and number series.", "topics": [{"name": 